# Everything the Go build doesn't need. Without this the build context pulled
# in node_modules and Vale's style packages — tens of megabytes docker has to
# hash and send to the daemon before the first instruction even runs.
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
.bun-cache/
styles/Google/
styles/proselint/
dist/
coverage.out
*.md
# The frontend build's own copy-changelog script needs this one - it's
# not documentation the image ships, it's the changelog page's own
# source.
!CHANGELOG.md

# Never bake a real secret into an image layer.
.env
